{"id":"leggermente","lemma":"leggermente","pos":"adv","rank":3144,"glosses":["mildly, gently","slightly","lightly, nimbly"],"ipa":"/led.d͡ʒerˈmen.te/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9f/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-leggermente.wav/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-leggermente.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"La porta era leggermente aperta.","en":"The door was slightly open.","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},null,{"g":"open","l":"aperto"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"a surname"]]},{"text":"Tre persone erano leggermente ferite.","en":"Three people were slightly injured.","words":[{"g":"three"},{"g":"person","l":"persona"},{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},null,{"g":"injury","l":"ferita"}]},{"text":"Mi sento leggermente malato.","en":"I feel slightly sick.","words":[{"g":"me / myself"},{"g":"to feel","l":"sentire"},null,{"g":"ill"}]},{"text":"Ero leggermente deluso.","en":"I was mildly disappointed.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},null,{"g":"disappointed"}]},{"text":"Siamo leggermente in ritardo.","en":"We're running a bit behind schedule.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"late"]]}]}